---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">
	<Nav variant="sub" current="about" />
	<h1 class="sr-only">About</h1>
	<p class="body">
	For the past 5 years, I’ve been a frontend engineer at Vimeo, building complex UIs used by millions of people daily.
	My path to software engineering is a bit unconventional: a background in psychology and HR keeps me attuned to user empathy, while my love for art gives me an eye for pixel-perfect detail and visual harmony.
	Outside of code, you’ll usually find me reading, painting with watercolors or oil pastels, and fostering cats. I also make CSS art: a few of my pieces have even been featured on CodePen!
	</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	.body {
		font-family: "EB Garamond", serif;
		font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 19px);
		line-height: 1.75;
		color: var(--color-body);
		max-width: 600px;
		margin-top: 64px;
	}
</style>
